- [ ] Initialize Next.js 14+ frontend with TypeScript, TailwindCSS, ShadCN UI
- [ ] Initialize FastAPI backend with project structure (API/Service/Repository layers)
- [ ] Set up PostgreSQL database schema with SQLAlchemy 2.0 + Alembic
- [ ] Configure Supabase Auth integration
- [ ] Create shared types/models

